/apps/Web_App: name "Web_App" must be a slug: a lowercase letter followed by up to 39 lowercase letters, digits or dashes
/env/NUM: expected string, got number
/env/lowercase: variable name "lowercase" must be UPPER_SNAKE_CASE: letters A-Z, digits and underscores, not starting with a digit
/project: "My Project" must be a slug: a lowercase letter followed by up to 39 lowercase letters, digits or dashes
/services/storage/buckets/Bad Bucket: name "Bad Bucket" must be a slug: a lowercase letter followed by up to 39 lowercase letters, digits or dashes
